ook of maps of JACK THE RIPPER, and the YORKSHIRE RIPPER on victims death location or placement. Notice he laid the Otero&#39;s out facing the door, and he did military style bedstacking of his victims. He had to have accomplice later on, one if not more that is both on his level, there are no passive -aggressive players here. When they allow me to post as not yet replied I shall put on Professor Canters locational maps of predators and you can chart them internationally yourself.  <BR>  <BR>There will be a pattern of time in victims that correlates with events and very early on prior to the air force he will have killed many times, for it is a way of legal murder joining the forces of narcissistic persons. Let them allow me to post, I have contacted the documentary maker who has filmed the btk issue as Firecracker films but as yet he has not got back to  me. <BR>They asked me in Vegas whao I thought of the Scott Peterson trial in October. <BR>  <BR>Right away I got an electric shock in the sub and went through death throes of being garotted from behind and pulled back over something as psychic experience.  <BR>In science in behaviours Peterson had the eye contact with the cameras that mirrored past murderers in dilated pupils that as an event we look up to &#39;see&#39; an experience or event, that event was the final moments of his victim. Try looking at every televised appeal of a person and see how they differ with the sound down, that is important. Those that use when sound up key words, such as in Zoey Evans case here, as &#39;when she comes home I am going to get her a puppy&#39; were keys to this army person having a dog in his mind, and straight away I knew where she was, dead. The route I took later took me past the gate with &#39;beware guard dogs&#39; and the yellow sign showing the head of the dog past the ranges to the sewer system. There she was found hours before I got there and I had never been to the place before. There is more earlier on spirit sending me where she was. I intend to put it all on my website as do not invite the media in what I see, but the lawmen and people who can interpret it.  <BR>  <BR>Let me know how I can help you. Dennis is taking it all on himself as someone was so close to nailing someone else and he could not allow that to happen for obvious reasons hence the rise from silence. Yes he would have killed again in a more bizarre and spectacular way than the Otero&#39;s to make a point as psychologists said in return of violence to prove himself as btk.Try Born to kill as btk and it is why he thinks he was destined to this role as his mantra.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
