<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11473"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tac<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tac<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, March 13, 2005 - 9:27 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->E, <BR> <BR>I don&#39;t know if I can help. I will try to periodically post method/MO of serial killers or commonalities, according to the psychological community, shared by these maniacs. <BR> <BR>The most obvious seems to be a hatred for their mothers. I don&#39;t know if Rader hated his mother but it has been speculated that the Zodiac despised his mom. <BR> <BR>Edward Kemper, 6&#39;9 man mountain, killed women and left the bodies around mountainous regions of Northern California. He hated his mom and if I am not mistaken made her his last victim.  <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
