y. He had knowledge gained by some more than primary first aid skill.  <BR>The use of cords repetition means they were and are symbolic in what he feels in his hands and the tension and access to these with ease over time. Where did the blinds go as a certain type over time.  <BR>To kill families he must have covetted as is famously said in some fiction film, &#39;as he coverts what he sees everyday&#39;. Stranger than fiction this is mental episodic memory, that done with the ease of tasks done daily and with patterns of behavioural processes, like making a cup of tea or driving to work.  <BR> <BR>p.d <BR>&#40;no login&#41; <BR>195.93.33.11 btk riddle <BR>No score for this post December 8 2004, 3:35 PM  <BR> <BR>&#60;<a href="http://www.crimelibrary.com/serial_killers/unsolved/btk/14.html?sect=4" target=_top>http://www.crimelibrary.com/serial_killers/unsolve d/btk/14.html?sect=4</a>&#62;  <BR>Reading of the faculty link, the poetic does not surprise me in a female run household. Father was a decorated man was he not in WW2. He in the placing of letters on return address shown does so with comma, full stop and spacing that is not needed and decidedly literature specific. In using the now antiquated way of typing in full comma use and the way the S. is not South and Oldmanor is used, I feel the use of the word ILL is definative, as Sefour is suffer. In words there is SAM as defined Son of Sam as hero&#39;s, was he really Sam&#39;s son in reality. In being inside university campus he could have been a technical person who worked at the university and had knowledge and uniform for the courses as administrator position, not student. He in using words and letters together is linking technical and authorship in a way that is technical engineering in language.  <BR>Take away 168 on both and it leaves 472 as simple Mensa test books do.  <BR>This person is in disquise and so normal he can drop off letters as in disguise, and is academically sound in mediocre ways as so normal he is above suspicion.  <BR>Cord to bind, umbilical connotation, as blinds have cords and are part of his former life. He used venetian blind cord because it was available to him as most familiar. I believe he is dying or has some fatal illness hence illman and the repeated letters late in life. He is not able to father children I think.  <BR>If psychics have gone as said they will have mixed messages of this one, as he pulsates information into the telepathy. He talks to an animal, a black dog that is not old, he has animals as friends, and books and computer, and uniform of blue. That is in psychic drawing given me in image of sounds to colours sat here. He is or has some badge of some sort. It is not a police badge. It I think is a military badge, or medal?  <BR> <BR>The mind and falsification of events.  <BR>Korsakoffe syndrome does this as severe chronic alcoholic, this man replies when it is most chronic. The brain being depleated of Vitamin B12 goes into half truths as only half of the story, but this is not the cause of it, the deception is to outwit, for life is mundane and so narcissicm means identity promoted. He will be searching on line for every instance of his &#39;fame&#39;, for now the years are in cyberspace and his fame is promoted in using the search engine.  <BR>He will as &#39;no job is too big for a narcissist&#39; page 165.  <BR>In this the lack of real social integration since no father figure has &#39;abandonment rage&#39; written all over it, humiliation, rejection and lack of social grooming, an outcast of his own making.  <BR>P.D <BR>&#40;no login&#41; <BR>195.93.33.11 railway murders <BR>No score for this post December 8 2004, 12:18 PM  <BR> <BR>A book came out of American serial killers and it made me think of the actions that mirror as Duffy in the railway murders in Professor Cantors book, &#39;Criminal Shadows&#39;, these are the method that as impressions they meticulate in giving off as transparencent communications of shadows. The author of the current book called &#39;Dark Truths, Modern theories of serial murder&#39; Pulitizer prize nominee, authors, published by Virgin, 2004 is very interesting in what makes mental actions a forensic interest or psychic wave transmission of energies for those concerned who read it.  <BR>Narcissism and serial murder.  <BR>My thoughts after becoming involved in environmental psychology, the familiar use of geology and space in the mind of the person and his/her empathy.  <BR>The lack of empathy and time frame for this communication and association immediately forms in the rythm. The use of initials. sit on the train and repeat btk, or ktb.  <BR>Looking at codes 4 72 is D, and no stroke above 7 is 12, as R. 168 - is Air Force. H. or as suggested his last three as 168 D.R, as repetition.  <BR>I have been following your site from UK as on a psychic message board we have and these are my posts. I am a scientist and psychic, not medium and do not inform media of my psychic ability as some do as it is instantaneous. Paula  <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
