<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11619"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tac<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tac<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 15, 2005 - 9:31 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Vscantu, <BR> <BR>Great knowledge and thanks for clearing up Kemper as I had read about his murdering his mother but I was still unsure if she was actually the last victim.  <BR> <BR>Henry Lee Lucas told stories of his mother prostituting herself out in front of a young Lucas in their home.  .  .  he hated his mother. <BR> <BR>Another significant aspect to many of these maniacs as they are frustrated want to be cops !  <BR> <BR>Kemper hung out in a cop bar but was rejected by the force. <BR> <BR>Gacy had an entire policeman&#39;s fantasy. <BR> <BR>It was speculated that the Zodiac used police tactics and may have been rejected by LE.  .  .   <BR> <BR>I am sure there are many others with the same mother hatred, lawenforcement rejection in their backgrounds.  .  .   <!--/Text--></td></tr>
