<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11675"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tac<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tac<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 16, 2005 - 4:49 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->E, <BR> <BR>One of the Zodiac&#39;s first victims Betty Lou Jensen was said to be the spitting image of one of his next victims Darlene Ferrin.  <BR> <BR>Cheri Jo Bates, if she is a Zodiac victim, and Celia Sheppard were similar in physical appearance to the aforementioned.  .  .   <BR> <BR>IMO the similarities which drew the Zodiac might have been due to a rejection by one of these women rather than a resemblance to his mother. <BR> <BR>Maybe it would be of interest to check on BTK&#39;s mothers apperance. If that is not a match check into any painful breakups or rejections BTK experienced. Somewhere in his past he began targeting a certain look that represented a possible tramatic nasty experience.  .  . <!--/Text--></td></tr>
