<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11792"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tac<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tac<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 18, 2005 - 12:49 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->E, <BR> <BR>A slang name for the Hell&#39;s Angels is 81 as &#34;H&#34; is the 8th letter in the alphabet and &#34;A&#34; the first.  <BR> <BR>BTK is 2,20,11 do these numbers mean anything to you in re: to the case ? Apologies if you have already looked at this or posted on this.  .  .  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
